    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit vague. i feel like the people pushing for vouchers are usually coming from a place of wanting to give kids a fair shot, whereas the opposition seems more focused on protecting the status quo of the system. do you think that's a fair way to frame the tension between the two sides?",
