      "content": "thanks. but look, if i use those terms, won't i get heat from the people who think vouchers are just a way to drain money from public schools? it feels like the \"protecting the system\" crowd is just making excuses to keep things exactly how they are, even if it hurts some kids. isn't it more accurate to say the main opposition is just trying to block progress and change?",
